# L §5.14.1 (tally 2.1.2, issue #32, the standing ruling "the engine follows the spec, refcore is fixed"): read at a
# point of the walk on day t, a projection "counts only the movements not yet booked". sw and sw_b are decisions of one
# stratum on 2026-01-10 (sw reads konto, sw_b reads savings; neither changes what the other reads), so sw runs first, by
# move id (E §4.1). sw_b's legs run between places its defs give, both refused (RUN-DIV), so its refusal holds for
# every place. sw's projection at its point counts sw_b's act, so sw's amount is refused. tally 2.1.1's refcore compared
# the point `sw|000000` with `sw_b` as one text (`_` before `|`), left sw_b's act out and printed q: 99.00 PLN; with
# sw_b named sx it refused, as here.
=== m.tally
model t
  tally 2
  on 2026-06-30
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31

source s "s"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01
kind pots: place PLN signed
kind sinks: place PLN signed outside
input day: date
input zero: int
input ahead: int
input amt: money PLN
place konto: accounts PLN lives 2026-01-01..
place savings: accounts PLN lives 2026-01-01..
place pot: pots lives 2026-01-01..
place sink: sinks lives 1900-01-01..
place world: outside lives 1900-01-01..

def src: key pots = if zero / zero > 0 then pot else pot
def snk: key sinks = if zero / zero > 0 then sink else sink

move sw: transfers
  on day
  reads konto
  leg cash from konto to world amount max(0 PLN, bal(konto, add_days(day, ahead)) from day - amt)

move sw_b: transfers
  on day
  reads savings
  leg cash from src to snk amount amt + 0 * bal(savings)

ask q: sw.cash.amount
ask r: bal(konto, 2026-01-09)
ask u: sw_b.cash.amount

version v
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2026-01-01
  day = 2026-01-10
  zero = 0
  ahead = 5
  amt = 1.00 PLN
  opening[konto] = 100.00 PLN at 2026-01-01 start
  opening[savings] = 50.00 PLN at 2026-01-01 start
  opening[pot] = 0 PLN at 2026-01-01 start
=== expect
q: refused: RUN-DIV division by zero
  cut 2026-06-30
r: 100.00 PLN
  cut 2026-06-30
u: refused: RUN-DIV division by zero
  cut 2026-06-30
